sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Gateway
  participant P1 as Orders
  participant P2 as Database
  participant P3 as Worker
  P0->>P1: Request with trace context
  P1->>P2: Child database span
  P2->>P1: Commit order and outbox
  P1->>P0: Response span completes
  P1->>P3: Event with trace link
  P3->>P2: New processing span and effect
  P3->>P1: Business completion event
